ADDITIONAL NOTICE — NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE

This repository documents research and a trading system built for the author's
own use. It is not investment advice, not a recommendation to trade, and not an
offer of any financial product or service. Leveraged futures positions can lose
more than the capital committed to them.

The research covers a single asset class over a limited sample period, and the
live-trading portion covers a period far too short to support any performance
conclusion. Nothing here has been validated for use by anyone other than the
author. If you run any part of this with real money, you do so entirely at your
own risk and should expect the possibility of total loss.

Market data referenced by this project is obtained from third-party providers
under their own terms; no market data is redistributed in this repository.
